h="184" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="8" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(105,119,135,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>SYNONYMOUS 1-CODON</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="498" topLeftY="126" width="184" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(176,116,24,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>362 rows</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="498" topLeftY="157" width="184" height="15"><content textType="body" fontSize="7" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(105,119,135,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>small eligible-looking subset</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="708" topLeftY="104" width="204" height="76" presetHandlers="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" width="1"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="718" topLeftY="110" width="184" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="8" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(105,119,135,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>OPERATIONAL CLUSTERS</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="718" topLeftY="126" width="184" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(206,65,102,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>1</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="718" topLeftY="157" width="184" height="15"><content textType="body" fontSize="7" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(105,119,135,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>not multi-protein OOD</p></content></shape><table topLeftX="48" topLeftY="204" width="864" height="220"><colgroup><col width="250"/><col width="360"/><col width="254"/></colgroup><tr height="28"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(24,37,51,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Observed constraint</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(24,37,51,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Consequence</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(24,37,51,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Scientific decision</p></content></td></tr><tr height="48"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Mixed variant composition</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Includes nonsynonymous, codon-pair and UTR variants beyond 362 synonymous single-codon rows</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>No general fixed-protein claim</p></content></td></tr><tr height="48"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(246,248,251,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>One operational cluster</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(246,248,251,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>No independent multi-protein cluster structure</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(246,248,251,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>No protein-family OOD claim</p></content></td></tr><tr height="48"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>RK20 passed only 2 / 8 sequence-OOD tests</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Functional robustness was not established before this audit</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>No retrospective success relabeling</p></content></td></tr><tr height="48"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(246,248,251,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Outcomes and new file-content hashes not read</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(246,248,251,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Only prior split summaries and metadata entered RK38</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgba(246,248,251,1)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" paddingLeft="7" paddingRight="7" paddingTop="2" paddingBottom="2"><p>Untouched evaluation remains false</p></content></td></tr></table><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="438" width="864" height="30" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(220,247,238,1)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="441" width="840" height="24"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,158,132,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" ><p>The audit establishes eligibility limits; it does not run or authorize an untouched evaluation.</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="474" width="864" height="30" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(253,231,237,1)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="477" width="840" height="24"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(206,65,102,1)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" ><p>functional_untouched_evaluated = false · new_functional_labels_read = false · functional_robustness_pass = false</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="510" width="810" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="7" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(105,119,135,1)" bold="false" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>Source: RK04 frozen split b5e3b24c0e30 · RK20 finalization af7cbcbc1f85 · RK38 metadata-only audit</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="886" topLeftY="507" width="28" height="17"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(24,37,51,1)" bold="true" textAlign="right" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.05" wrap="false"><p>184</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body"><p>The functional-untouched partition contains 19,072 rows and 13,569 construct-signature groups.</p><p>Only 362 rows are synonymous single-codon variants and there is one operational cluster.</p><p>The partition therefore cannot independently support a general multi-protein fixed-protein conclusion.</p><p>RK38 did not read untouched outcomes or perform a functional evaluation.</p></content></note></slide>